  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>&bull; Brand introduction:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Our swimwear was designed to be inclusive of all women, with a focus on flattering and empowering them. The microtan fabric is exceptional, allowing sunlight to pass through its micro perforations for a uniform and golden tan. Forget about tan lines and their negative impact on hot summer days - <a href=\"https://www.qikini.com/pages/about-us\">Qikini</a> not only boosts your confidence, but it also enhances your body's absorption of Vitamin D, a crucial nutrient for maintaining healthy bones and teeth. Trust us - getting that extra dose of Vitamin D can be a game changer for your overall health.</p>\r\n<p>Additionally, <a href=\"https://www.qikini.com/collections\">Qikini bikinis</a> have been proven to dry up to 7 times faster than traditional swimwear. This feature eliminates the need to stay in a damp bikini, reducing the risk of UTIs, which can be quite uncomfortable.</p>\r\n<p>Qikini has been meticulously designed for an entire year to achieve the perfect combination of comfort and sophistication, while maintaining durability and an incredibly soft feel. The \"microtan\" fabric is made with thousands of micro perforations, providing breathability and making it the ideal choice for long-term wear.</p>\r\n<p>Our first collection of Qikini is inspired by the stunning Greek Sporades and its crystal clear waters. The design ensures a perfect fit and comfortable feel for anyone who wears them.</p>\r\n<p>Discover the life-changing benefits of Qikini and revolutionize your tanning routine today.</p>\r\n</div>",
